flowchart TD
A[Client Request<br/>Tenant.platform.com/api/v1/users] --> B[main.ts<br/>global prefix /api/v1]

    B --> C{TenantMiddleware}

    C -->|Platform route or non-API| P[Skip tenant resolution]
    C -->|Tenant API route| D{Resolve Tenant}

    D -->|Tenant ID header| E1[TenantService.findById]
    D -->|Tenant slug header| E2[TenantService.findBySlug]
    D -->|Host subdomain| E3[TenantService.findBySubdomain]

    E1 --> F{Tenant found}
    E2 --> F
    E3 --> F

    F -->|No| G[No tenant context]
    F -->|Yes| H[Set req.tenant<br/>Tenant AsyncLocalStorage]

    H --> I[JwtGuard]

    I -->|Public route| J[Skip authentication]
    I -->|No token| K[401 No token provided]
    I -->|Invalid token| L[401 Invalid token]
    I -->|Valid token| M{Route type}

    M -->|Platform route| N{Token has tenant}
    N -->|Yes| O[403 Platform token required]
    N -->|No| Q[Load platform user<br/>from public schema]

    M -->|Tenant route| R{Token tenant matches<br/>resolved tenant}
    R -->|No| S[403 Token does not belong to tenant]
    R -->|Yes| T[Load tenant user<br/>role and permissions]

    Q --> U{PermissionGuard}
    T --> U

    U -->|Missing permission| V[403 Forbidden]
    U -->|Permission granted| W[Controller]

    W --> X[TenantManagerService<br/>getDataSource]

    X --> Y[(Tenant PostgreSQL schema)]
    Y --> Z[Response]